1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:04,963
Hello!

5
00:00:05,513 --> 00:00:08,981
Let's meet some animals and hear what they say!

6
00:00:10,331 --> 00:00:12,259
Look! It's a cat.

7
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:13,626
Cat!

8
00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:16,128
What does the cat say?

9
00:00:17,528 --> 00:00:18,960
Meow, meow!

10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:22,024
Who is this?

11
00:00:23,824 --> 00:00:25,477
It's a dog!

12
00:00:26,027 --> 00:00:27,980
What does the dog say?

13
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,549
Woof, woof!

14
00:00:31,899 --> 00:00:33,851
Look! It's a cow.

15
00:00:34,351 --> 00:00:35,319
Cow!

16
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:37,821
What does the cow say?

17
00:00:39,221 --> 00:00:40,008
Moo!

18
00:00:41,358 --> 00:00:43,310
Look! It's a duck.

19
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:44,717
Duck!

20
00:00:45,267 --> 00:00:47,148
What does the duck say?

21
00:00:48,548 --> 00:00:49,637
Quack, quack!

22
00:00:50,987 --> 00:00:52,701
Who is this?

23
00:00:54,501 --> 00:00:56,114
It's a sheep!

24
00:00:56,664 --> 00:00:58,569
What does the sheep say?

25
00:00:59,969 --> 00:01:01,098
Baa, baa!

26
00:01:02,448 --> 00:01:04,472
Look! It's a pig.

27
00:01:04,972 --> 00:01:05,980
Pig!

28
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,458
What does the pig say?

29
00:01:09,858 --> 00:01:10,987
Oink, oink!

30
00:01:12,337 --> 00:01:14,290
Look! It's a horse.

31
00:01:14,790 --> 00:01:15,878
Horse!

32
00:01:16,428 --> 00:01:18,357
What does the horse say?

33
00:01:19,757 --> 00:01:20,523
Neigh!

34
00:01:21,873 --> 00:01:23,587
Who is this?

35
00:01:25,387 --> 00:01:27,222
It's a lion!

36
00:01:27,772 --> 00:01:29,819
What does the lion say?

37
00:01:31,219 --> 00:01:32,086
Roar!

38
00:01:33,436 --> 00:01:35,341
Look! It's a bee.

39
00:01:35,841 --> 00:01:36,829
Bee!

40
00:01:37,379 --> 00:01:39,308
What does the bee say?

41
00:01:40,708 --> 00:01:42,159
Buzz, buzz!

42
00:01:43,509 --> 00:01:45,438
Look! It's a chick.

43
00:01:45,938 --> 00:01:46,805
Chick!

44
00:01:47,355 --> 00:01:49,307
What does the chick say?

45
00:01:50,707 --> 00:01:51,816
Cheep, cheep!

46
00:01:53,166 --> 00:01:56,029
Yay! We met so many animals!

47
00:01:56,579 --> 00:01:58,817
Great job, little learner!

48
00:01:59,367 --> 00:02:01,255
Share Mimzi with a friend,

49
00:02:01,255 --> 00:02:03,795
and subscribe for more learning fun!

50
00:02:04,345 --> 00:02:05,333
Next time,

51
00:02:05,333 --> 00:02:07,611
let's learn our body parts.

52
00:02:07,861 --> 00:02:09,232
Bye bye!
